@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<section class="privacy-hero full-bleed-section">
    <div class="privacy-hero-inner">
        <span>PRIVACY AT QIGLO</span>
        <h1>Your information,<br />handled with care.</h1>
        <p>This policy explains how the QIGLO Restaurant System uses information when you create an account, reserve a table, place an order or contact our team.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<div class="privacy-page">
    <aside class="privacy-summary">
        <span>Last updated</span>
        <strong>24 August 2026</strong>
        <p>Questions about this policy?</p>
        <a href="mailto:keekm-wm25@student.tarc.edu.my">Contact the QIGLO team</a>
    </aside>

    <div class="privacy-content">
        <section><span>01</span><div><h2>Information we collect</h2><p>We may collect the information you provide when using QIGLO, including your name, email address, phone number and account details. When you use our dining services, the system may also store reservation information, table selections, orders, payment records and receipt details.</p></div></section>
        <section><span>02</span><div><h2>How we use information</h2><p>Your information is used to provide the functions you request: managing accounts, confirming reservations, checking guests in, preparing orders, recording payments, issuing receipts and responding to enquiries. Operational records may also help authorised staff maintain service quality and system security.</p></div></section>
        <section><span>03</span><div><h2>Cookies and authentication</h2><p>QIGLO uses essential authentication cookies to keep signed-in users connected securely and to apply the correct access permissions. These cookies support core system functions and are not used for third-party advertising.</p></div></section>
        <section><span>04</span><div><h2>Storage and security</h2><p>Access to customer and operational information is limited according to user roles. Passwords are protected using secure hashing, while login and important system activities may be recorded to support accountability and detect misuse.</p></div></section>
        <section><span>05</span><div><h2>Your choices</h2><p>You may review and update available profile information through your account. To ask about your information or request assistance, contact the QIGLO team using the email addresses or telephone numbers provided in the website footer.</p></div></section>
        <section><span>06</span><div><h2>Changes to this policy</h2><p>This policy may be updated when the system or its services change. The latest version will remain available on this page together with its updated date.</p></div></section>
    </div>
</div>
